## 1. Company Overview

Founded in 1990, SkyHigh Airlines has grown to become a leading carrier in North America and has expanded its international routes to Europe and Asia. Our headquarters is located in Denver International Airport (DEN), with regional hubs in Los Angeles (LAX), Chicago O'Hare (ORD), and New York John F. Kennedy (JFK).

